[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0010","text":"辛苦了，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0020","text":"今天的拍摄，不是拍得挺好的嘛……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0030","text":"嘿嘿……\n谢谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0040","text":"因为……\n上镜的技巧……小奈教了我一点……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0050","text":"哈哈，是这样的呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0060","text":"还有……探班送的塔……\n很好吃，这点也很好……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0070","text":"嗯，好像是附近一家有名的店\n不愧是名店，确实好吃"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0080","text":"有名……\n原来如此……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0090","text":"……点心的事……\n偶尔，小奈会告诉我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0100","text":"除此之外……\n完全不知道……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0110","text":"是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0120","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0130","text":"甜花，休息日也……\n在家打游戏，上网……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0140","text":"还有，躺着发呆什么的……\n净干这些……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0150","text":"上网查点心什么的──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0160","text":"不会查……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0170","text":"是、是吗……\n──对了，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0180","text":"要不要稍微绕个路？\n偶尔在外面玩玩，我觉得也不错哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0190","text":"……诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0200","text":"甜花喜欢的地方，\n哪里都行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0210","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0220","text":"……啊，那就────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0230","text":"──交给甜花吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0232","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0233","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0234","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0235","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0236","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0240","text":"……好厉…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0250","text":"好厉害啊，甜花……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0260","text":"嘿嘿……\n也没那么厉害──啦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0270","text":"感觉我一直在被你照顾着呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0280","text":"那是……\n没办法的事……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0290","text":"因为……有擅长的人……\n也有……不擅长的人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0300","text":"哈、哈哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0310","text":"不过，甜花……\n能和Producer先生一起打游戏……好开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0320","text":"哦，是吗……！\n偶尔在外面玩玩也不错吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0330","text":"嗯……！\n换换心情，挺好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0340","text":"还想……再和Producer先生……\n一起来游戏厅……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0341","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0350","text":"可以……吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0360","text":"当然可以\n──对了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0370","text":"把它当作努力完成训练和工作的\n奖励，怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0380","text":"诶——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0390","text":"是、是啊……\n……嗯，知道了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_15000000_03_0400","text":"那样的话……\n甜花，下次也会……继续加油的……！"}]
